  "provenance": {
    "reference": "llama.cpp's own hybriddna engine on this artifact (llm_tokenizer_hybriddna_session, llama-vocab.cpp:1640) — Carbon-3B's tokenizer has no independent Python implementation in its repository, so llama.cpp is the definition here, as it is for plamo2 (ADR-0050)",
